        "english": "shut → open (open for, be opened) • insert → pull out (pull out for) • plug → unplug",
        "explanation": "Vowel height harmony (-u vs. -o) and /l/ retention (-ul-/-ol-) in the reversive extension (Ngonyani & Ngowa 2016, pp. 271–284)"
